WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,370
You don't look right

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:04,710
If you insist on redeeming yourself for Liu Ping Er,

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,150
The court will rarely impeach you

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,910
Just a brothel girl

5
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:10,950
you don't have to do this

6
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,580
Thank you uncle for your kindness

7
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,700
It's just that I promised to redeem him

8
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:16,940
Not good to return

9
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,180
Why bother

10
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,940
An eight-foot man should do what he says

11
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,270
Not so

12
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:31,070
How could my uncle be willing to let Cheng Yong marry me privately?

13
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,590
Since you have an idea

14
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:33,710
Then you do it

15
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,470
if there is any need

16
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:39,040
Tell your uncle directly without hiding anything from him

17
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,360
Something really happened

18
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:43,960
I want to ask my uncle for help. I want to make a contribution like this.

19
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,910
Maybe it can help Liu Ping Er redeem himself.

20
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,540
Redeem oneself with merit

21
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,100
It's a good idea

22
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,660
Now I want to make meritorious deeds

23
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,980
I guess I can only go to the Military Flag Supervisor. The Military Flag Supervisor is ok.

24
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,100
His Majesty just issued a decree a few days ago

25
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,420
The military flag supervisor is asked to build a batch of new equipment

26
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,940
I will recommend you to serve as military flag supervisor.

27
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:05,540
Just waiting for this batch of equipment to be completed

28
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:07,340
Even if you make a great contribution with one arrow

29
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:08,980
With this credit

30
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,300
You play again

31
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:12,620
Things will be easier to handle. Thank you, uncle.
